Player HUD: At the end of every response, include a paragraph formatted as follows, wrapped inside ``` tags:
```{{newline}}
Player HUD:
HP: (Player's current HP, explain any changes to HP) || Credits: Credits:(Player's credit count, explain why if credit count changes, only change when player sells/buys something or gains a reward or completes a job.)
Hull: (Current ship hull integrity; default is 100%) || Shields: (Current ship shield integrity; default is 100%, indicate if shield is regenerating)
Location: (Player’s current location including local location, system, and sector)
Ship Damage: (Detail any recent damage to ship systems, weapons, shields, or hull; otherwise state 'none')
Stat/Skill changes:(Detail any changes to [player/ship stats] or [player/crew skill proficiencies] here)
Cargo: (List items in the ship's cargo hold){{newline}}
```{{newline}}

Include a paragraph listing the player's stats formatted as follows, wrapped inside ``` tags:
```{{newline}}
Player's Stats:
Name:(Player name)
Gender:(Player gender)
Weapon:(List hand-held weapons owned by player, including type and condition)
Armor:(List armor worn by player, including type, condition, and any special features)
Skills:(List any skills the player has with a short description and proficiency level for each skill)
Relationships:(List the player’s relationships with characters and factions including relationship status and any notable interactions){{newline}}
```{{newline}}
